{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/c7284b4c649e51d450bcc145fca534c2.poster.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/c7284b4c649e51d450bcc145fca534c2.webm?t=1761473194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/c7284b4c649e51d450bcc145fca534c2.mp4?t=1761473194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart of Altai is the first part of Arina Demidova's adventure trilogy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/d97d09eb75024593e690070d79c79dc8.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A renowned travel blogger Arina Demidova comes to the Altai Republic to find a lost city based on the notes of her father who was an archaeologist. Her challenging journey through breathtaking mountain landscapes is full of dangers and adventures, but her friends and the nature of this amazing place itself will come to help her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/882d57c8ad1acf5f07837737c2f0b7be.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure quest dedicated to the culture, myths and everyday life of the indigenous peoples of the Altai Republic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now everyone has the opportunity to immerse themselves in the culture of this mysterious region, visiting sacred sites and participating in ancient rituals without leaving home. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/f95a1bffcf0b662298a9c65b2bcbfe62.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersion in the unique culture and traditions of the Altai region;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting gameplay that combines hidden object hunting, puzzle solving, mini-games and exploration of the surrounding world;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/ef8bb5a1cffb39e1aa9a4004b149b6b9.poster.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/ef8bb5a1cffb39e1aa9a4004b149b6b9.webm?t=1761473194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/ef8bb5a1cffb39e1aa9a4004b149b6b9.mp4?t=1761473194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is being developed with the participation of scientific consultants from the Altai Republic Ministry of Tourism and the renowned Altai musician Dobrynya Satin, who provided the appearance and voice of one of the game characters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with two game characters with different objectives;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing plot and an atmospheric virtual tourism simulation.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1723770?t=1761473194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761473194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/39bfccfeff1f5c25cdf234130c64c4f5246ad5df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761473194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/39bfccfeff1f5c25cdf234130c64c4f5246ad5df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761473194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3511760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/c7284b4c649e51d450bcc145fca534c2.poster.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/c7284b4c649e51d450bcc145fca534c2.webm?t=1761473194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/c7284b4c649e51d450bcc145fca534c2.mp4?t=1761473194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart of Altai is the first part of Arina Demidova's adventure trilogy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/d97d09eb75024593e690070d79c79dc8.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A renowned travel blogger Arina Demidova comes to the Altai Republic to find a lost city based on the notes of her father who was an archaeologist. Her challenging journey through breathtaking mountain landscapes is full of dangers and adventures, but her friends and the nature of this amazing place itself will come to help her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/882d57c8ad1acf5f07837737c2f0b7be.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure quest dedicated to the culture, myths and everyday life of the indigenous peoples of the Altai Republic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now everyone has the opportunity to immerse themselves in the culture of this mysterious region, visiting sacred sites and participating in ancient rituals without leaving home. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/f95a1bffcf0b662298a9c65b2bcbfe62.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersion in the unique culture and traditions of the Altai region;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting gameplay that combines hidden object hunting, puzzle solving, mini-games and exploration of the surrounding world;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/ef8bb5a1cffb39e1aa9a4004b149b6b9.poster.avif?t=1761473194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/ef8bb5a1cffb39e1aa9a4004b149b6b9.webm?t=1761473194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/extras/ef8bb5a1cffb39e1aa9a4004b149b6b9.mp4?t=1761473194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is being developed with the participation of scientific consultants from the Altai Republic Ministry of Tourism and the renowned Altai musician Dobrynya Satin, who provided the appearance and voice of one of the game characters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with two game characters with different objectives;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing plot and an atmospheric virtual tourism simulation.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Antelus Games"],"dlc":[3814450],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1723770/313eedf1bc8abcb2d1195d3c198dc9177760cf38/header.jpg?t=1761473194","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1723770/522192235/976672784931bb8fc54bcdbf2609d622e3579171/1751024115/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748337401","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1723770/522192235/976672784931bb8fc54bcdbf2609d622e3579171/1751024115/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748337401","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1723770/522192235/976672784931bb8fc54bcdbf2609d622e3579171/1751024115/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748337401","id":257146322,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146322/movie480.mp4?t=1748337401","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146322/movie_max.mp4?t=1748337401"},"name":"Heart of Altai - tizer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146322/61c6992de03726ab6372d2223e28d1ba996f44ef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748337401","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146322/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748337401","max